ous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/652613f6c3658e6bafbc7b1eb3870418.poster.avif?t=1737758940\" width=800 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/652613f6c3658e6bafbc7b1eb3870418.webm?t=1737758940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>With the various melee weapons in game, you can find your favourite. Do you prefer faster attacks? Power Katana is the perfect one for you! Are you more tactical, you want to wait around the corner, or predict your enemy's movement? Rocket Fists will deliver powerful attacks but each one has to be charged up. Try them all out, and you will find what is best for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/be001fb98a095b4062a5d5b5486d84d6.avif?t=1737758940\" data-has-big width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/264ce15b4d7ec99223a9e731a4cd55fc.poster.avif?t=1737758940\" width=800 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/264ce15b4d7ec99223a9e731a4cd55fc.webm?t=1737758940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Each loadout have 3 skills. One passive, one active, and one ultimate. Ultimates need to be charged up, but when it's usable, they have high impact. Use Bubble Shield to protect your party from any damage, or Tornado, to demolish anyone close to the impact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/132cc8b0a8b5fec5ca3231108119aba7.avif?t=1737758940\" data-has-big width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/1da59f0d0d9c34474bd9aa61530f139d.poster.avif?t=1737758940\" width=800 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/1da59f0d0d9c34474bd9aa61530f139d.webm?t=1737758940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Return to the roots of multiplayer gaming! Create your own room, select game mode, map, and other settings, and start your own game! Play multiple rounds with the same people if you want, or choose a different, the choice is in your hands!</p>",
